        "original_id": "385a6d11-21cb-5597-b5f4-24862817e94e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Emily Beecham, Sean Connery, Richard Loncraine Dunn\n- Works: Into the Badlands, The Calling\n- Organizations: AMC, Edinburgh International Film Festival\n- Roles: Joanna\n- Topics: acting career, television premieres, film awards\n\nFacts:\n- Emily Beecham is an English-American actress.\n- In 2009, Emily Beecham made her debut leading performance as Joanna in Dunn's third feature film, The Calling.\n- In 2009, The Calling was selected as Best of the Fest at the Edinburgh International Film Festival.\n- In 2009, Emily Beecham received a New Talent Trailblazer Award presented by Sean Connery during The Calling's debut.\n- Into the Badlands is an American television series that premiered on AMC on November 15, 2015.\n- Emily Beecham is best known for her role in the AMC television series Into the Badlands.\n- AMC renewed Into the Badlands for a 10-episode second season that premiered on March 19, 2017.",
